<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01492#stereotype_beach_attire> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The woman is wearing a black swimsuit and a pink visor, which is a common type of beach attire. The meme uses this attire to create a humorous contrast between the expected behavior (wearing sunscreen, a hat, or staying out of the sun) and the actual behavior (wearing a visor, which is not typically associated with sun protection in this context). This juxtaposition is the source of the meme's humor, and it relies on the viewer's understanding of social norms and expectations around beach attire and sun protection."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#faceMasking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "face masking"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01492#stereotype_beach_attire> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#extractionTimestamp> "2025-12-12T02:55:25.107064" .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01492#stereotype_women_on_beach> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image of a woman on a beach wearing a swimsuit and visor is a common visual trope. The meme uses this trope to create a humorous contrast between the expected behavior (wearing sunscreen, a hat, or staying out of the sun) and the actual behavior (wearing a visor, which is not typically associated with sun protection in this context). This juxtaposition is the source of the meme's humor, and it relies on the viewer's understanding of social norms and expectations around beach attire and sun protection."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#perspectivallyContradicting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#narrativeFlowAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:ndab2d21bc577464b81cc1ed472bb7fe6b61 .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01492#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "woman is mapped as 'i don't like the sun so i wear a visor'"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#contradicts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#relatesTo> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01492#woman_on_beach> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman is standing on a sandy beach, wearing a black swimsuit and a pink visor. The background shows the ocean and sky, suggesting a beach setting. The woman is the central subject, framed to highlight her appearance and the visor she is wearing. The text overlay reads 'i don't like the sun so i wear a visor,' creating a humorous or ironic context."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#comparativelyPositionedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates text positioned between elements being compared or contrasted in memes"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#TemporalRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#DimensionsInterrelation> .
