<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01492#ironic_discomfort> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The woman's facial expression is neutral to slightly confrontational, with a direct gaze and a closed mouth, which, combined with the absurd text 'i don't like the sun so i wear a visor,' creates an ironic tone. The expression does not convey genuine discomfort but rather a deadpan, humorous reaction to the situation, enhancing the meme's comedic effect through juxtaposition."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#entityOccluding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#selectivelyMasking> .
